hould be consumed with caution by individuals with galactosemia. Additionally, fresh fruits or juices may need to be eliminated from the diet prior to specific medical tests to avoid false positives.\n\nIt is advised to prefer fresh fruits over commercial jams, which may contain gluten. Overall, FRUTAS are a vital aspect of dietary recommendations for both children and adults, promoting overall health and well-being.", "DIESTRO:El diestro es un término que puede referirse a la mano dominante de una persona, relevante en el contexto de la deglución y la alimentación.", "ALERGENOS:ALERGENOS refers to allergens that must be disclosed in food products, such as Galleta Maria, to ensure consumer safety. These allergens are substances that can trigger allergic reactions, with the most common being peanuts, nuts, and shellfish. The control of allergens is particularly important in food production, especially for patients with dysphagia, as it helps prevent adverse reactions. Additionally, allergens must be clearly highlighted on food labeling to inform consumers and promote safe consumption.", "MÉTODO DE CRIBADO:", "UNIDADES DE DISFAGIA:Healthcare organizations that are interdisciplinary and multidisciplinary, focusing on the treatment and management of dysphagia.", "RED ETS:A national network of agencies for the evaluation of health technologies in Spain, with AETSA as a key reference.", "ALIMENTACION ADAPTADA TRADICIONAL:Traditional adapted food designed for individuals with swallowing difficulties, typically in a pureed form.", "ALIMENTACION ADAPTADA COMERCIAL:Commercially prepared food options that are adapted for individuals with swallowing difficulties, often in pureed form.", "TEXURAS:Different food textures that can be modified for individuals with dysphagia to facilitate easier swallowing.", "TRATAMIENTO REHABILITADOR:Rehabilitative treatment aimed at patients diagnosed with oropharyngeal dysphagia, involving various educational and compensatory techniques.", "EVALUACIÓN DE TECNOLOGÍAS SANITARIAS DE ANDALUCÍA:Evaluación de Tecnologías Sanitarias de Andalucía is a key organization in Spain for evaluating digital health technologies at a European level.", "PROYECTOS:Projects in digital technology are initiatives aimed at improving the management and understanding of dysphagia.", "HOSPITAL LA FE:Hospital La Fe, also known as Hospital Universitari i Politècnic La Fe, is a prominent medical facility located in Valencia, Spain. This university and polyclinic hospital offers a wide range of medical services, with a particular emphasis on nutritional support and dietetics. It provides enteral nutrition formulas specifically designed for diabetes patients, as well as various treatments for individuals undergoing surgical procedures or those suffering from nutritional deficiencies. The institution is dedicated to delivering specialized care to patients with diverse medical conditions, ensuring comprehensive healthcare and support.", "J.F. MERINO TORRES:J.F. Merino Torres is a prominent figure in the field of nutritional management, particularly in relation to diabetes in cystic fibrosis patients. He is a co-author of a chapter that specifically addresses the nutritional management of this condition. Additionally, he has contributed to various chapters that discuss nutritional requirements and assessments within a medical context, as well as the topic of artificial nutrition. Beyond his authorship, J.F. Merino Torres serves as the coordinator of the Comisión de Nutrición Artificial, Dietética y Dietoterapia at Hospital La Fe, where he is responsible for overseeing nutritional care, further highlighting his expertise and commitment to the field of nutrition.", "COMISIÓN DE NUTRICIÓN ARTIFICIAL, DIETÉTICA Y DIETOTERAPIA:The Comisión de Nutrición Artificial, Dietética y Dietoterapia is a committee at Hospital La Fe that focuses on nutritional care and guidelines for patients.", "DEPARTAMENTO DE SALUD VALENCIA LA FE:The Department of Health Valencia La Fe is a healthcare organization dedicated to enhancing clinical practices and patient care in Valencia. It serves as the governing body responsible for overseeing health services at Hospital La Fe, which includes the management of nutrition services. Through its initiatives, the Department aims to improve the overall quality of healthcare delivery in the region."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}